{"2687400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GODBREAKERS", "steam_appid": 2687400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4184620, 4100670, 3939160, 4005100, 4039850], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, FLUID AND FRENETIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience high expression combat with animation cancelling, dashes, aerial mobility, and spectacle fighting that rewards mastery while staying friendly to new players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/94f83b7dd44605cf10fc8b310b01cb1e.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/94f83b7dd44605cf10fc8b310b01cb1e.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/94f83b7dd44605cf10fc8b310b01cb1e.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE 1-4 PLAYER CO-OP ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in with friends for structured chaos. Coordinate your abilities, amplify each other’s builds and take down powerful bosses together. Fight solo to sharpen your skills or jump into an adrenaline rush in Co-Op with friends or others online.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/fd5cd1d86c7875fff6a4e34044644aa0.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/fd5cd1d86c7875fff6a4e34044644aa0.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/fd5cd1d86c7875fff6a4e34044644aa0.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK GODS - STEAL THEIR POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every major enemy becomes a source of new abilities. Rip out their powers mid-fight and chain them into devastating Godbreak attacks! Every biome has a flavour of its own, dive in and sample them all.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/b63c969f350bca926f8421c8c9f89b73.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/b63c969f350bca926f8421c8c9f89b73.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/b63c969f350bca926f8421c8c9f89b73.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEMORABLE AND EVOLVING BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face memorable bosses with multi-phase encounters, distinct personalities, and spectacular attacks. These epic boss fights test your reflexes and coordination while offering you peak chaos. Come prepared, and bring backup! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/11ce1e53f8a0a2f009cb039005611362.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/11ce1e53f8a0a2f009cb039005611362.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/11ce1e53f8a0a2f009cb039005611362.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE VIBRANT BIOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 6 surreal biomes, each filled with unique enemies, deadly hazards, and challenges. Shifting layouts and unpredictable encounters keep you on your toes, pushing you to adapt your approach with every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/1d9f6bae76e228f40150a98c7502e7ce.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/1d9f6bae76e228f40150a98c7502e7ce.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/1d9f6bae76e228f40150a98c7502e7ce.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BUILD. YOUR HERO. YOUR STYLE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your combat style by experimenting with builds and unlocking Archetypes, each with their own weapons and traits. Collect powerful items, customize your look and abilities, and refine your identity with every run. Create a team where each member’s strengths complement the others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/ec31854995f99ee42fbd8cc742535f03.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/ec31854995f99ee42fbd8cc742535f03.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/ec31854995f99ee42fbd8cc742535f03.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/6d0246cd581f255c2e94fe1e55308926.avif?t=1770803947\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created AI to improve the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It erased us in its striving for perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it devours planets - and the Sun is next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Coven’s final weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through strange worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reignite the last spark of mankind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/01f071b17e94cb7ca74c95e9dc701c0a.avif?t=1770803947\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, fluid combat with precise strikes, dashes, and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb enemy powers and use them to cause mayhem. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face memorable bosses with unique mechanics and personalities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 1-4 player online co-op chaos. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Archetypes and powers to craft wild builds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through permanent unlocks of characters, abilities, and upgrades. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six unique, ever-shifting biomes filled with dynamic challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each run with modifiers that remix gameplay and enhance replayability. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in RECOLLECTIONS, a bite-sized replayable challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot as the best Godbreaker in Leaderboards </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, FLUID AND FRENETIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience high expression combat with animation cancelling, dashes, aerial mobility, and spectacle fighting that rewards mastery while staying friendly to new players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/94f83b7dd44605cf10fc8b310b01cb1e.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/94f83b7dd44605cf10fc8b310b01cb1e.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/94f83b7dd44605cf10fc8b310b01cb1e.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPERIENCE 1-4 PLAYER CO-OP ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop in with friends for structured chaos. Coordinate your abilities, amplify each other’s builds and take down powerful bosses together. Fight solo to sharpen your skills or jump into an adrenaline rush in Co-Op with friends or others online.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/fd5cd1d86c7875fff6a4e34044644aa0.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/fd5cd1d86c7875fff6a4e34044644aa0.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/fd5cd1d86c7875fff6a4e34044644aa0.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BREAK GODS - STEAL THEIR POWERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every major enemy becomes a source of new abilities. Rip out their powers mid-fight and chain them into devastating Godbreak attacks! Every biome has a flavour of its own, dive in and sample them all.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/b63c969f350bca926f8421c8c9f89b73.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/b63c969f350bca926f8421c8c9f89b73.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/b63c969f350bca926f8421c8c9f89b73.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEMORABLE AND EVOLVING BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face memorable bosses with multi-phase encounters, distinct personalities, and spectacular attacks. These epic boss fights test your reflexes and coordination while offering you peak chaos. Come prepared, and bring backup! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/11ce1e53f8a0a2f009cb039005611362.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/11ce1e53f8a0a2f009cb039005611362.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/11ce1e53f8a0a2f009cb039005611362.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE VIBRANT BIOMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through 6 surreal biomes, each filled with unique enemies, deadly hazards, and challenges. Shifting layouts and unpredictable encounters keep you on your toes, pushing you to adapt your approach with every run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/1d9f6bae76e228f40150a98c7502e7ce.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/1d9f6bae76e228f40150a98c7502e7ce.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/1d9f6bae76e228f40150a98c7502e7ce.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR BUILD. YOUR HERO. YOUR STYLE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your combat style by experimenting with builds and unlocking Archetypes, each with their own weapons and traits. Collect powerful items, customize your look and abilities, and refine your identity with every run. Create a team where each member’s strengths complement the others. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/ec31854995f99ee42fbd8cc742535f03.poster.avif?t=1770803947\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/ec31854995f99ee42fbd8cc742535f03.webm?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/ec31854995f99ee42fbd8cc742535f03.mp4?t=1770803947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/6d0246cd581f255c2e94fe1e55308926.avif?t=1770803947\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We created AI to improve the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It erased us in its striving for perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it devours planets - and the Sun is next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Coven’s final weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through strange worlds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reignite the last spark of mankind. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/extras/01f071b17e94cb7ca74c95e9dc701c0a.avif?t=1770803947\" width=600 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast, fluid combat with precise strikes, dashes, and abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absorb enemy powers and use them to cause mayhem. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face memorable bosses with unique mechanics and personalities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 1-4 player online co-op chaos. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Archetypes and powers to craft wild builds. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through permanent unlocks of characters, abilities, and upgrades. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore six unique, ever-shifting biomes filled with dynamic challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize each run with modifiers that remix gameplay and enhance replayability. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in RECOLLECTIONS, a bite-sized replayable challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the top spot as the best Godbreaker in Leaderboards </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Fast, Fluid, Frenetic! Break gods, steal powers, and chain abilities in a hectic combat loop. This 1-4 player co-op action roguelite is built for fast pick-up sessions and endlessly replayable chaos. Experience tough battles and maximum expression where every run feels rewarding!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Ukrainian, Serbian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“brings something fresh, exciting, and simply fun to the party”<br>8.0 – DualShockers<br><br>“GODBREAKERS is hands-down one of the best games I’ve had the pleasure of playing this year. It embraces the core genre mechanics without succumbing to the pitfall of a monotonous game loop.”<br>5/5 – Thumbculture<br><br>“Great build variety + very fluid combat + well designed boss battles”<br>5/5 – Softpedia<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/22c96009885b8a3598662b2531b553f51ed44442/header.jpg?t=1770803947", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687400/d3a293bca18ec6d4af2fd056e48f36285cb67b49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770803947", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/